# PHASE 19 — ADVANCED PARENT & STUDENT PORTAL + ONLINE SCHOOL SERVICES

## IMPORTANT CONTEXT

This is PHASE 19 of an already-developed, production-oriented, multi-school School ERP.

DO NOT create a new application.

DO NOT rebuild the ERP from scratch.

DO NOT create a second Parent Portal or Student Portal.

DO NOT duplicate existing modules.

You must first inspect the existing codebase, database schema, authentication system, RBAC, school isolation, Student Management, Parent Management, Admissions, Attendance, Fees, Examination, Homework, Timetable, Transport, Hostel, Library, HR, Communication, Administration, Student Lifecycle, Certificate Management, Mobile/PWA and MIS modules.

